WEBVTT

00:07:57.392 --> 00:08:00.390
Aaaaa, jako dobro.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.132
Sada ćemo zagrijati usne,

00:08:02.132 --> 00:08:04.484
i krenut ćemo ovako ba, ba, ba, ba,

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:07.436
ba, ba, ba, ba. Jako dobro.

00:08:07.436 --> 00:08:10.876
A sada, brrrrrrrrrrrr,

00:08:10.876 --> 00:08:12.326
kao kad ste bili dijete.

00:08:12.326 --> 00:08:14.853
Brrrr. Sada bi vaše usne 
trebale početi oživljavati.

00:08:14.853 --> 00:08:16.428
Potom ćemo raditi na jeziku

00:08:16.428 --> 00:08:20.850
s prenaglašenim 
la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.360
Prekrasno. Postajete stvarno dobri u ovome.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:25.955
A sada zarolajte R.. Rrrrrrr.

00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:28.171
To vam dođe kao šampanjac za jezik.

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.491
Konačno, ako mogu samo jedno napraviti,